              "But here\u2019s something else. In the days that followed, over 20 countries sent rescue teams. Millions of dollars were donated by ordinary people worldwide. Neighbours in Japan helped strangers. Schools took in families. It was one of the darkest weeks in modern history \u2014 and one of the most moving.",
