              "4 essential numbers: hundred (100), thousand (1,000), ten thousand (10,000), million (1,000,000). Stay SINGULAR when used with a number (\u201cthree million people\u201d NOT millions). Plural for approximations (\u201cmillions of trees\u201d = many millions).",
              "PASSIVE VOICE = when the SUBJECT receives the action, not does it. Formula: <em>be + past participle (V3)</em>.",
